            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Quantum computing, Affirm, Netflix upgrade: Market Minute",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance host<em>\u00a0</em><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/madison-mills/\">Madison Mills</a> catches investors up on this morning's top trending stocks in this<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\"> Market Minute</a>, including shares of quantum computing developers IonQ (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IONQ\">IONQ</a>), D-Wave Quantum (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/QBTS\">QBTS</a>), and Rigetti Computing (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RGTI\">RGTI</a>) ahead of <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/nvidia-gtc-ionq-rigetti-d-134018585.html\">a panel event at Nvidia's 2025 GTC </a>(<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>); Affirm's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AFRM\">AFRM</a>) stock reaction to Klarna replacing it as Walmart's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WMT\">WMT</a>) \"buy now, pay later\" provider; and Netflix's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) latest upgrade from the team out of MoffettNathanson.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
